        <mxCell id="train-body" value="&lt;b&gt;Mixed missingness training:&lt;/b&gt; ConcatDataset(Easy m≤4 ∪ Hard m≥4) — optimizer steps and sample exposure matched / reported against condition-specific arms&#160;&#160;·&#160;&#160;&lt;b&gt;Protocol:&lt;/b&gt; TrajImpute direct (no imputation), ETH/UCY folds; train-adapt and zero-shot robustness kept separate&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gates:&lt;/b&gt; five-metric (minADE · minFDE · MR · ADE@1/FDE@1 · b-minFDE) + high-missing m=6/7 + macro/micro agreement + seed band + negative controls (time-shuffled / random neighbors)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;align=left;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="712" width="1570" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
